iKestrel
Copyright 2026 Ted Mecimore

iKestrel is a new codebase. Its design follows iOwl and iKnow
(https://github.com/8rank/iKnow, by the Eighth Rank), both licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0: local only, read-only on every handle, a fresh
token at every start, counts-only reports, and "not measured is not zero".
No code from either project is copied here. The credit is for the design and
for the forensic groundwork that made it possible.
